# Copy to web/.env.local. Gitignored.

# Where the crafter is. It runs on a real machine, not on Vercel — Blender
# cannot live in a serverless function. Without this the site reports the bench
# as offline and shows the checked-in sample, which is what a deployment does
# when nobody's laptop is awake.
CRAFTER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# The paying agent. When this is set the site asks it for a craft instead of
# calling the crafter directly, and the browser shows each stage being paid for.
# It runs beside the crafter on the same machine, because that is where the
# wallet is and the browser must never see a private key.
AGENT_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4403
